# Svelte UI Stack

- Target **Svelte 5** with **runes** (`$state`, `$derived`, `$props`, `$effect`, …). Do not introduce Svelte 4 store/`let` reactivity patterns for new code.
- Prefer **flowbite-svelte** UI components over hand-rolled HTML/CSS for tables, inputs, toggles, buttons, etc. Use raw markup only when Flowbite has no fit or the interaction is trivial text.

```svelte
// ✅ GOOD
import { Table, Input, Toggle } from 'flowbite-svelte';

// ❌ BAD — reinvent Flowbite-covered widgets with plain HTML
```
